    "answer": {
      "short": "$8\\frac{1}{3}$ litres",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}12\\frac{1}{4}-3\\frac{11}{12}&=\\frac{49}{4}-\\frac{47}{12}\\\\&=\\frac{147}{12}-\\frac{47}{12}\\\\&=\\frac{100}{12}\\\\&=\\frac{25}{3}\\\\&=8\\frac{1}{3}\\end{align*}$$\nThere are $8\\frac{1}{3}$ litres of water left in the barrel.",
